[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=TCP Client Dynamic IP v1.1.usp\\\\Simpl# TCP client that matches||1
  Cmn2=the built-in SIMPL Windows TCP/IP Client\\symbol (Connect, Connect_FB,||1
  Cmn3=TX$, RX$, status) except the remote host is\\a serial input, not||1
  Cmn4=an IP-table / Address parameter. No IP-ID required.\\\\Hold Connect||1
  Cmn5=high to open the socket. Release Connect to close it.\\Address$||1
  Cmn6=is IPv4 or a hostname. Empty Address$ will not connect.\\A change||1
  Cmn7=to Address$ or Port_Override while Connect is high reconnects.\\
  Cmn8=Port_Override greater than 0 replaces the Port parameter; 0 uses||1
  Cmn9=Port.\\\\If the remote end drops while Connect is still high, the||1
  Cmn10=client waits\\100 ms then retries (same idea as the stock client||1
  Cmn11=on CUZ 3.029+).\\\\Status is debounced 1.0s while Connect is held.
  Cmn12=||1A dead host retries\\every 100 ms and would otherwise flicker 0d/1d.
  Cmn13=||1The output stays on\\1d (Waiting) until some other code has sat||1
  Cmn14=unchanged for 1.0s.\\Connected (2d) and a release of Connect update||1
  Cmn15=immediately.\\Connect_FB follows the socket with no debounce.\\\\
  Cmn16=TX$ is sent as-is (no extra CR/LF) and only while connected. RX$||1
  Cmn17=is a\\byte pipe, chunked at 250 characters.\\\\status (stock TCP/IP||1
  Cmn18=Client values):\\  0d  Not connected\\  1d  Waiting for connection\\
  Cmn19=||22d  Connected\\  3d  Connection failed\\  4d  Connection broken||1
  Cmn20=remotely\\  5d  Connection broken locally\\  6d  Performing DNS||1
  Cmn21=lookup\\  7d  DNS lookup failed\\  8d  DNS lookup resolved\\\\Bench:
  Cmn22=||1Testing-Tools start-tcp-server.bat (port 23). Address$ is the\\
  Cmn23=PC LAN IP, not 127.0.0.1. Run allow-firewall.bat as Administrator||1
  Cmn24=once\\or Windows Firewall will drop the processor.\\\\4-Series only.
  Cmn25=||1Keep DynamicTcp_v1_1.clz in this folder.\\v1.0 keeps Dynamic_TCP_Client.
  Cmn26=clz. Do not replace that library.\\\\VERSION HISTORY\\v1.1  2026-
  Cmn27=10-29  RGW\\- Debounce Status 1.0s while Connect is held so a dead||1
  Cmn28=host does not\\  flicker 0d/1d. Connected and disconnect still update||1
  Cmn29=immediately.\\- Simpl# library is DynamicTcp_v1_1. v1.0 keeps Dynamic_TCP_Client.
  Cmn30=\\v1.0  2026-09-02  RGW\\- Initial public module
[END]
